      <activity id="891efb4a-2b05-5076-9c8b-ca26059d8b81" activityNameId="b891c8ee-afd2-5985-9882-97d2c2a4e1af" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Coffee ground pellets, burned in furnace, ash to landfarming</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Coffee ground pellets, burned in furnace, ash to landfarming
Air emission coffee ground data completed with ecoinvent inventory of "pellets, mixed, burned in furnace 15kW";
UUID: 106b4b24-5b7e-399b-90c6-e1be716dbd04
This data set describes the emission into air caused by the combustion, infrastructure, fuelinput and transport are included
Location: The inventory is modelled for a pilot plant in Switzerland
Technology: Furnace 25kW
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: Several air emissions estimated with data for wood combustion.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_106b4b24-5b7e-399b-90c6-e1be716dbd04.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
